  "title": "Sausage Cornbread Bake",
  "description": "A slice of this tangy cornbread reveals a hidden layer of sausage, onion, and Cheddar. It's a nice sit-down meal or a great grab-and-go snack.",
  "authors": [
    "Debbie Rowe"
  ],
  "date_published": "1998-10-12T21:44:47-04:00",
